msgstr ""
"`doc` 取的是 tree-sitter 解析出来的 docstring，* 不是 * "
"实体之前那段完整的注释块。函数体内部的行内注释永远进不了嵌入输入。"

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch10-embeddings-and-vector-stores.md:112
#: 600d670c281d4a26ba6a4fa8f5c21434
msgid ""
"The body is **omitted on purpose**. It is persisted, truncated to 4 000 "
"characters, on the entity row and used only by the retriever and the "
"generator."
msgstr "函数体 **是故意省略的** 。它会以截断到 4000 字符的形式存在实体行上，只给检索器和生成器用。"

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch10-embeddings-and-vector-stores.md:116
#: c903346450ef43bb89e38dd6d7b83758
msgid ""
"**2 — Batch + backoff + rate-limit.** Embedding APIs are slow, metered, and "
"flaky. The enricher wraps three primitives around every call: batch size "
"(default 50 — set in `CODE_KG_EMBEDDING_BATCH_SIZE`), exponential backoff "
"(base 500 ms, `maxRetries` attempts), and an optional per-minute rate limit "
"that sleeps to keep the caller under a configured RPS."
msgstr ""
"**2 —— 批量 + 退避 + 限速。** 嵌入 API 又慢、又按量计费、又容易抖动。enricher 在每次调用外面包了三件基本装备：批大小（默认"
" 50，由 `CODE_KG_EMBEDDING_BATCH_SIZE` 控制）、指数退避（初始 500 ms，最多 `maxRetries` "
"次），以及一个可选的按分钟限速器，用 sleep 把调用方压在配置好的 RPS 之下。"

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch10-embeddings-and-vector-stores.md:123
#: 9f0c1c5971ab43b496279c054f311a53
msgid ""
"**3 — Store choice is a decision matrix.** Three dimensions: *how many users"
" share one index*, *how many vectors do you expect at steady state*, and "
"*what's the operational cost you're willing to pay*."
msgstr ""
"**3 —— 存储选择是一份决策矩阵。** 三个维度： * 共享一个索引的用户数 * 、* 稳态下预期的向量数量 * 、* 你愿意承担的运维成本 * 。"

