#: cb86b946c4824d958a49411dd09d5909
msgid ""
"`BuildEntityInput` is called once per entity inside "
"`Service.generateAndStoreEmbeddings`, which in turn batches 50 entities at a"
" time and persists the resulting vectors with the **same ID** that the graph"
" node (Chapter 11) and the entity row (Chapter 9) share:"
msgstr ""
"`BuildEntityInput` 会在 `Service.generateAndStoreEmbeddings` "
"里对每个实体调一次；这个方法本身再按 50 个一批地组织调用，并用 **和图谱节点（第 11 章）以及实体行（第 9 章）完全相同的 ID** "
"把得到的向量持久化下来："

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch10-embeddings-and-vector-stores.md:239
#: d4dc43dc53ca472289145940602d2375
msgid ""
"The `Upsert(ID, vector)` call is what makes the same sqlite row addressable "
"from the entity store, the vector store, and the graph store in exact "
"equivalence — Chapter 11 depends on this."
msgstr ""
"`Upsert(ID, vector)` 这次调用，正是让“同一条 sqlite 行”能在实体存储、向量存储、图谱存储三者里以完全等价的 ID "
"被寻址的关键 —— 第 11 章依赖这一点。"

