msgid ""
"The package name is historical: the author prototyped with Postgres + "
"pgvector first, then switched to sqlite-vec for distribution simplicity. The"
" interface survived. To swap in real pgvector you write one additional "
"implementation (120-ish lines) and change one line in `NewService`. That is "
"the intended upgrade path."
msgstr ""
"包名来自历史：作者最早用 Postgres + pgvector 做原型，后来为了分发简单切到了 sqlite-vec。接口存活了下来。要换回真正的 "
"pgvector，你需要再写一份实现（大概 120 行），并在 `NewService` 里改一行。这就是预期中的升级路径。"

